hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1769","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke mushrikeen mein se log they jinhon-ne qatl kya tha aur bahut kya tha aur zina kya tha aur bahut kya tha. To wo Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Beshak jo tum kehtey ho aur jise tum daawat detey ho achha hai. Kaash tum hamein khabar do ke jo ham ne kya uska kaffaara hai. To naazil hui: (Aur jo Allah key sath doosra mabood nahi pukaartey aur na us jaan ko qatl kartey hain jise Allah ne haraam kya hai magar haq key sath aur na zina kartey hain). Aur naazil hui: (Kaho: Ae merey bandon jinhon-ne apni jaanon par ziyaadti ki, Allah ki rehmat se mayoos na ho). (Bukhari: 4810). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur unhon-ne Allah ki qadr nahi ki jaisi uski qadr ka haq hai)."
"1770","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ahbaar mein se aalim Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To us ne kaha: Ae Muhammad! Beshak ham paatey hain ke Allah aasmaanon ko ungli par rakhta hai. Aur zameenon ko ungli par. Aur darkhton ko ungli par. Aur paani aur mitti ko ungli par. Aur baaqi makhlooq ko ungli par. To wo farmaata hai: Main Baadshah hun! To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hansay yahan tak ke Aapki daadhein zaahir huin, aalim key qaul ki tasdeeq mein. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne padha: (Aur unhon-ne Allah ki qadr nahi ki jaisi uski qadr ka haq hai. Aur zameen sab uski mutthi mein hogi Qiyaamat key din. Aur aasmaan uskey daaen haath mein lapetey jaaengey. Wo paak aur buland hai jo wo shareek kartey hain). (Bukhari: 4811). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur zameen sab uski mutthi mein hogi Qiyaamat key din)."
"1771","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Allah zameen ko mutthi mein leyga aur aasmaanon ko apne daaen haath mein lapeteyga, phir farmaaeyga: Main Baadshah hun! Zameen key baadshah kahaan hain? (Bukhari: 4812). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur soor mein phoonka jaaeyga aur behosh ho jaaeyga jo aasmaanon mein hai aur jo zameen mein hai) aayat."
"1772","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Do phoonkon key darmiyaan chaalees hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae Abu Hurairah! Chaalees din? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne inkaar kya. Unhon-ne kaha: Chaalees saal? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne inkaar kya. Unhon-ne kaha: Chaalees mahiney? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne inkaar kya. Aur insaan mein se har cheez gal jaaeygi magar uski dum ki haddi, us mein makhlooq jodi jaaeygi. (Bukhari: 4814). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Magar rishtedaari mein mohabbat)."
